msgctxt "164"
msgid "Aaauuugh! Not this again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Whether you fall down or not, nothing seems to work for you, does it, buddy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Aniki? Maybe we aren't cut out for this kind of work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "So, what now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Heh... I guess we go look for greener pastures. Make a fresh start in some "
"other town..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, and here's that payment I promised.\r\n"
"This is for all the trouble we caused you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Huh? You're that guy from last time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Hm? Shouldn't you be falling down or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Aren't you still bumping into people and asking them to pay your medical "
"bills?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Oh, that old scam? Nah, we put that life behind us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Falling down and pretending to be hurt got tiring. It's easier to just "
"demand the cash up front."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"So now you're shaking people down for their lunch money. Isn't that a step "
"backward for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"What was that, wise-ass? Fuck with us and we'll throw ya into the Kubochi "
"River!"
msgstr ""

